### Bin Packing Problem

The following Minizinc model solves the bin packing problem. The goal is to assign each item to a bin such that the total weight of items in each bin does not exceed the given capacity.

```minizinc
% Bin Packing Problem

% Input data
int: num_items;
int: num_bins;
int: capacity;
array[1..num_items] of int: weights;

% Decision variable: bin assigned to each item
array[1..num_items] of var 1..num_bins: bins;

% Constraint: total weight of items in each bin should not exceed capacity
constraint forall(b in 1..num_bins) (
    sum(i in 1..num_items where bins[i] = b)(weights[i]) <= capacity
);

% Solve the problem
solve satisfy;

% Output the solution
output [
    show(bins)
];
```

